# LIGHTNING — it strikes where you point.
#
# No particle and no sound of our own: a lightning bolt is already the loudest, brightest thing in
# the game, and adding a telegraph to it only muddies the strike.
# the one who used it is spared (item/WishBoltGuard) — a bolt at what a sword hit reaches him too.
function effect()
    /tag @s[type=minecraft:player] add moddy_bolt_maker
${BOLTS}
end
